window.products.push({"id":860026,"name":"Minthouz Cube Timer, 2 Pieces Kitchen Timer 2.6 Inch Gravity Sensor Flip Digital Timer for Time Management and Countdown Settings, 1 3 5 10 Minutes an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514jZ-MWcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶【8 Different Settings】You will receive 2 pieces cube timers in different colors, including 1 piece gravity sensor flip timer of 1, 3, 5, 10 minutes (black), and 1 pieces gravity sensor flip timer of 15, 20, 30, 60 minutes (blue), 8 settings are sufficient for you to use or replace in daily life. ▶【Modern Design】 The cube timer has one switch to control the volume (high and low), you can choose different volumes according to different occasions. The timer has a display screen, you can check the remaining time at any time. It requires 2 AAA batteries (not included), which can support the cube timer to work for 6 - 8 months. Also, its small size and rounded-corner design are easy to hold. ▶【Simple Operation】Our cubic digital timer is easy to use. Just turn the switch, place the desired time face up to start the timer, you will hear a beep and the non-glaring red light will flash. When the time is up, the alarm will beep again, just turn the blank face up to end timing. ▶【Suitable for Multiple Scenarios】The practical cube timer is a nice time management tool for home cooking, children's study, company office, game, physical exercise and other activities. It is a best gift for your family and friends. ▶【Timer Cube Advantages】It's a gravity sensor timer, no need to control mechanically. Compared to an original timer, it has two volume adjustments and is easy to use without cumbersome operation. Besides, silicone coatings cover makes this timer electrostatic-proof and makes you have the feelings of touching skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514jZ-MWcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minthouz","source_asin":"B0B7B92FBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7B92FBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7B92FBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
