window.products.push({"id":860087,"name":"ECM. 2pc Ruffled Window Treatment Decor Cascade Panel Curtain Set for Living, Dining Room, Bedroom 2 Panels (Pair), 84” x 54” Decor (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKn9RJEWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This curtain set is a great value for anyone looking for a shabby chic window treatment with the wow factor. The ruffles that run the length of the curtains and across the bottom of the panels give this set an understated elegance that will definitely catch the eye of your visitors. This window curtain is not lined, so it will allow plenty of natural light into your room while also providing ample privacy from neighbors and strangers outside your home. This window curtain set is ideal for girls and women of all ages. You can use this set in your baby’s nursery, your daughter’s first big girl bedroom, a teen or young adult’s bedroom, master bedroom or any space where you want to add luxurious texture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKn9RJEWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECM.","source_asin":"B07T7DCRT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T7DCRT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T7DCRT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860088,"name":"Kombucha Heating Wrap - Heating Pad with Adjustable Temperature Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TW7OOWXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We custom-designed this wrap exclusively for kombucha home fermentation. It has an adjustable hook-and-loop strap to snugly fit your brewing vessel and a four-setting temperature controller to always keep your brew in the ideal temperature range. Description: Temperature control is the key to brewing consistently great kombucha. Simply place this wrap around the mid-section of your brew jar, fasten with the hook-and-loop strap, and plug into any 120 v grounded outlet. For easy viewing of the included adhesive temperature strip, apply it to the side of your glass jar in the small vertical window between the two ends of the mat. Use this heat wrap year-round as the temperature fluctuates in your home. The mat is made of waterproof material and designed to be left plugged in and on for an indefinite amount of time. Easily adjust the temperature with the variable heat settings and an \"off\" setting for when additional heat isn't needed. AMBIENT TEMPERATURE     |    CONTROLLER SETTING 60° - 65°                                      High 66° - 70°                                    Medium 71° - 73°                                        Low 75° - 81°                                        Off TARGET BREWING TEMP: 75° - 81° Information: Available in two color options - basic black and our limited edition print. It can be used on ceramic, porcelain, stainless steel or glass. Includes (1) Adhesive Temperature Gauge. Dimensions: 19 x 5 in. Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TW7OOWXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kombucha Shop","source_asin":"B07B7BQXQ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B7BQXQ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B7BQXQ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
