window.products.push({"id":860101,"name":"Granddaughter, I Love You to The Moon Musical Glitter Globe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IvB12mwFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your granddaughter brings a twinkle to your eye like no other. She is certainly the light of your life! Now, you can let her know how special she is with the charming Granddaughter, I Love You To The Moon Glitter Globe, exclusively from The Bradford Exchange. Filled with glitter, shimmer and shine, your granddaughter is sure to treasure this beautifully crafted glitter globe for years to come!This sparkling glitter globe features a silvery base that tells your granddaughter you'll love her \"to the moon and back.\" The striking globe above shimmers with star-shaped glitter that swirls around a crescent moon. The moon showcases pavé-style crystals and delights with a dangling heart adorned with a glass jewel. For the perfect finishing touch, this keepsake plays \"Always in My Heart.\" Sure to thrill your granddaughter, it's a gift straight from your heart. But strong demand is expected for this limited-edition musical glitter globe, so order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IvB12mwFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B013TMW97C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013TMW97C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013TMW97C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860102,"name":"Jack Meets Kate Coquette Room Decor Aesthetic, Cottagecore Posters, Vintage Decor, Photo Collage Kit, Wall Decor for Bedroom Aesthetic, Teen Girls Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GfmslgdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT YOU GET- 50 pieces of 4x6 inch cottagecore aesthetic pictures and 1 exquisite packaging box. The Wall collage kit covers up to 12 square feet of wall space. Each photo needs to be taped to the wall and can be arranged in any way desired. VISUALLY STUNNING- JACK MEETS KATE cottagecore posters are printed on a thick semi-gloss paper with a subtle matte finish to add texture and enhance the details of each image. We hope that these beautiful aesthetic pictures will add some color and sunshine to your walls and bring a smile to your face. AESTHETIC ROOM DECOR- Cute aesthetic pictures for teen girls bedroom, preppy room decor, locker decor, dorm room decor, bedroom decor for women, boho room decor, indie room decor, dark academia room decor, sage green room decor, vintage room decor, aesthetic room decor peaceful, fairycore, farmhouse room decor, coquette, hippie, witchy room decor, and cool room decor. ECO-FRIENDLY PRINTING - We use soy ink for prints. Soy ink is made from soybeans. Compared to traditional petroleum-based ink, soy-based ink is accepted as more environmentally friendly. While slower to dry than many inks, it provides more accurate colors and makes it easier to recycle paper. Soy ink is renewable and biodegradable. Soy is less costly to grow than other alternatives and less soy ink is required for the same amount of printouts. Soy ink is easier to remove when recycled. PERFECT GIFT IDEA- Share your love for the classic and groovy by giving this aesthetic pictures pack as a gift. The ideal gift for any birthday, Christmas, Hanukkah, graduation, or occasion that calls for a celebration. Great gift for teenage girls and boys, friends, and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GfmslgdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jack Meets Kate","source_asin":"B097LWQP9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097LWQP9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097LWQP9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
