window.products.push({"id":860240,"name":"BEEY Chaise Lounge Chair 59\" Modern Chaise Lounge Indoor Upholstered Chaise Sofa Chair Recliner Lounge Sleeper Chair for Bedroom Living Room Chaise Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-g3weRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tufted Chaise Chair:This tufted armchair features comfortable and extraordinary sturdy with 19.5\" H backrest and 46\"D cushioned recliner bed which can bear up to 500 lbs, provides comfy sit on for extended periods.The rolled arm with nailhead trim around the base adds emphasis to the lengthy structure while nailhead accents pop against the smooth fabric Chaise Lounge Indoor:Overall size: 33.5\"/ H x 34\"/ W x 59\"/D; Seat dimensions: 46\"/ L x 34\"/ W x 19.8\"/ H.Side curved rolled tufted armrest meets contemporary clean lines, streamlined design, and modern comfort, perfect for placing your book/magazine / Laptop when you lie - down With Removable Cushion:The Chaise features thick padded seat cushion and soft backrest for excellent sitting or lying experience, with armrest and pillow for extra comfort. Easy clean thanks to the removable cover Casual Lounge sofa Couch :This living room sleeper couch chairs add subtle comfort to your bedroom or living room.Whether revisiting your favorite novel or catching the evening news before heading to bed,chaise lounges provide a cozy place to perch and kick your feet up. The rolled arm adds emphasis to the lengthy structure while contemporary design pops against the smooth fabric Chaise lounger for Small Space:The chaise fits for compact living room, waiting room, hotel, reception, cafe, bedroom and office which provide you a small space to relax Easy to Assembly:There are accessories and instruction included,you can simple assembly them within 10-15 minutes by guiding the instruction.PLEASE NOTE:All the pieces you need are ZIPPED UNDER THE BASE OF THIS CHAISE This chaise lounger indoor was shipped from CA, and it will take 3-5 days for item arrives.If any parts are missing or damaged after you receive the package, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you in 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i-g3weRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEEY","source_asin":"B08GKM33CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GKM33CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GKM33CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
