window.products.push({"id":860252,"name":"Spancraft 18\" X 36\" Rectangle Clear Glass Table Top 1/2\" Thick with Flat Polished Edge and Touch Corners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":153.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E2SXDOm0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"18\" x 36\" RECTANGLE GLASS TOPS Features: Finest quality furniture glass. Edges and corners expertly polished. Expertly packed to ensure safe arrival. Glass is individually cartoned with styrofoam protection. Free bumpons included to place between glass tops & base. 18\" x 36\" RECTANGLE GLASS TOPS The 18\" x 36\" Rectangle Glass top has a thickness of 1/2 inches. This clear glass table top is made from the finest quality furniture glass and weighs 40bs It's touch edges are smooth and flat polished so that it creates a bright and smooth feel. The glass tables edges and corners are expertly polished for a beautiful and quality look - plus, it's tempered at no additional cost!This rectangle glass top is perfect for those pieces of furniture that are hard to fit. It is also good as a replacement glass or to give any small coffee table, side table or bed stand a new look and feel. This clear glass rectangle top is good for protecting table tops while still being stylish. Glass top tables have a variety of uses in the home so it is one of the more popular items used for home or office decorating today. It will give any space no matter how small a new style while complimenting the original piece. It is also small enough to be used as an accent piece for smaller item, such as flower vases, figurines, or small pieces of art to help display the items. Also, can be used for outdoor events by placing them on top of the table cloth to help keep the look of the table.Each beautiful rectangle glass top comes with free bumpons that are placed between the glass and the base of the table to protect them. The glass tops are also professionally packed in their own individual cartons with styrofoam to help protect from breakage during shipment. The 18\" x 36\" Rectangle glass top will be sent quickly via FedEx or common carrier and is insured to for","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E2SXDOm0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spancraft","source_asin":"B004E5W5O6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004E5W5O6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004E5W5O6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
