window.products.push({"id":860265,"name":"Reusable Multi-Purpose Storage Bags 4 pack Leakproof PEVA Ziplock Freezer bags for Kids Snack,Sandwich,Lunch,Food,Travel Organizer (Pink, Pack Of 4 (4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ac0wd3hRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% Safe PEVA Material】The reusable storage bags are made of from thick (0.4mm) food-grade and PEVA material, Free from BPA , chlorine and lead which makes it perfect for storing kid's sandwich and snack. These food storage bags can effectively extend the shelf life of food, healthy and 100% safe. You and your family can use it with confidence! 【Value Pack & Multi-Purpose】The pack consists of 6 bags in one sizes: 6 snack bags (8.5 inches x 5.3 inches). These zip lock storage bags are perfect to store anything such as baby food, fruits, vegetables, meat, jewellery, office and kitchen stationary, tools, make-up and travel accessories. Translucent design allows easy view of content inside. 【Leak-Proof & Freezer Safe】 The updated reusable snack bags is easier to open and close than silicone bags. We made improvements to the zipper and the edge of the bag to give it wider edges and added an anti-slip design for stronger sealing. So this reusable sandwich bag is better maintain the freshness of the food, and you can use it to carry liquid food without any concern! Its leak-proof feature allows food from freezer burn, which retains the flavor and color of the food. 【Easy to Clean & Durable】 A quick hand wash in room temperature water and dry them standing bottom-up or with a dry towel makes the reusable food bags ready to use again and saves more time. Our foodsaver zipper bags are more durable because of the thick material and can reuse hundreds of times. However, we don’t recommend putting them in dishwasher or microwave. They are small and simple, but they can be widely used and can bring convenience to every aspect of your life! 【Go green for a better tomorrow】Using our PEVA bags is the better way of reducing the use of disposable plastic bags to save our planet and money. PEVA reusable zip lock storage bags will not pollute the environment even if they are discarded. This food storage bag can replace up to 500 single-use bags. You will be the hero of protecting the environment!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ac0wd3hRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIOFRESH","source_asin":"B09MBLL5VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MBLL5VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MBLL5VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
