window.products.push({"id":860498,"name":"NaturalCozy 5-Piece Round Small Woven Baskets Set - 100% Natural Cotton Rope Baskets! Key Tray, Kids Montessori Toys, Bowl for Entryway, Jewelry Remot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q90xJ4ttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE FLOPPY, WEIRDLY SHAPED BASKETS: “My baskets came flat and now they won’t stand up straight!” If this sounds familiar, you may be a victim of “squashed basket syndrome.” Not on our watch! While competitors send folded baskets that droop and sag, ours are stacked together in their own box so they don’t get smushed during shipping. No more sad, floppy organizer bins! 5 BASKETS FOR 5X THE ORGANIZING POWER: Life is messy...but your house doesn’t have to be! With five beautiful rope baskets for organizing, you’ll defeat messy rooms like a true supermom! Use the largest baskets for Montessori toy displays or countertop fruits holder, create the cutest remote basket with the medium size container and stash jewelry or keys in the smallest one. 5 lovely sizes Biggest (10.0”x3.5”), (9.1”x3.1”), (8.7”x2.9”), (7.3”x2.5”), Smallest (6.3”x2.2”) MADE FROM SAFE, NATURAL COTTON: Nom, nom, nom! When you’re revamping the nursery with some seriously stylish toy storage, your little one is bound to turn basket handles into their own personal teethers. No worries, mom! Our woven baskets are made from 100% natural cotton, so they’re completely safe for little mouths and hands. No toxic chemicals or ingredients! Plus, you won’t find a single faux leather anywhere that could be harmful for your little one or your pet. ELEGANTLY DESIGNED TO MATCH ANY DECOR: Classic neutral colors that match ANY design scheme? Yes, please! From boho chic to rustic farmhouse, modern and traditional design schemes, our storage baskets make the perfect accents to any decor. Plus, you won’t find a single tacky logo anywhere in sight! DOUBLE REINFORCED & SCATCH-FREE DESIGN: When you’re a full-time mom or dad, you need a storage solution that works just as hard as you do. With reinforced stitching on the handles and base, our storage basket set is ready to tackle some heavy-duty actions and will sustain the roughest toddler play. With our soft yet firm handwoven rope basket designs, you’ll never have to worry about scratches or marks being left on your coffee table, shelf, front door table, nightstand or any tabletop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q90xJ4ttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NaturalCozy","source_asin":"B09FLRFGQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLRFGQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLRFGQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
