window.products.push({"id":860503,"name":"Wishlantern Submersible LED Tea Lights (Waterproof) Brand (4, White Twin LED)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vVNHvTlAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for high quality, waterproof LED lights to add a warm ambience to your next event? Birando stocks a range of submersible LEDs also known as Floralytes that lights up in various beautiful hues. We offer these beautiful LED lights in both single and double LED types to add different levels of brightness to your event. When it comes to decorating with these simple, elegant lights, the options are endless. There are tons of ways you can use these lights. You can put them in candle bags, pop them in a flower vase, or even place them in your pond or pool, the list goes on! As they are completely waterproof they can go where no other LED light dares to go","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vVNHvTlAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wishlantern","source_asin":"B06XJ9KTKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XJ9KTKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XJ9KTKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860504,"name":"Dowan 8 oz Porcelain Ramekin Oven Safe, Ramekins Bowls with Handle, Easy to Hold, Ceramic Ramekins for Baking Creme Brulee Souffle Dessert, Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zgj+6zPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant and User-friendly Double Handles -- Designed with a small \"ear\" on both sides, the ramekin bowls can be easily picked up when hot especially using them to bake creme brulee, custard or souffle from the microwave, oven or hot water bath, without burning your finger. Must-have Kitchen Ramekins -- The multi-functional partner for your everyday use! The 8 oz square ramekins are perfect for baking dessert, like creme brulee, souffle, pudding, custard. Also great for portion control and individual serving, including sauces, condiments, appetizers, or other snacks. More functions are waiting for you. Reliable Material & Oven Safe -- Unlike paper or other materials, our ramekin dishes are made of sturdy and heat-resistant porcelain, Lead & Cadmium free. No worry about harmful materials penetrating into food! The creme brulee ramekins are durable and safe to put in the dishwasher, microwave, freezer, and oven up to 500°. Easy to Clean & Stack -- Smooth porcelain surface makes the 8 oz ramekins easy to clean by hands or dishwasher. Well-designed stackability does not waste counter space. Wide top and narrow bottom design makes the ramekins well stackable. Widely-used Special Ramekins -- A nice change from the traditional round style to unique square, the white ramekins are attractive enough to surprise your guest on gathering/party. Also a sweet gift to bring freshness and uniqueness to family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zgj+6zPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWAN","source_asin":"B08CXP9DT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXP9DT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXP9DT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860505,"name":"NONATHEO - Colander Set | 3 Different Shapes Collapsible Colanders | Includes 3 Folding Silicone Strainers | Safe Kitchen Folding Strainer for Pasta,V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SHZmkQaYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY AND SAFE MATERIAL - Our collapsible colander is made of safe and healthy silicone material, it is BPA free and without peculiar smell. Our colanders will not have any impact on your health. Howhever, please note that its high temperature resistance limit is 175℉ so please do not put it in the oven or in any other places where the temperature is too high. CREATIVE DESIGN - The strainers have ergonomic/robust plastic handles and large hollowed-out side and bottom with evenly distributed drainage holes which will drain excess water easily compared to traditional design. MULTI-USE - Our collapsible colander can be used to clean and dry different type of foods, such as pasta, salad leaves, potatoes, fresh vegetables, fresh fruits, meat, etc. Due to its foldable functionality, our drainers are an ideal choice for your camping vacation or trip. CONTENT OF EACH SET - Each package contains 3 different shapes of strainers which are 1 (S) Round (24.5 x 10cm), 1 (M) Square (27.4 x 11cm) and 1 (L) Oval (31.2 x 13cm). You can be imaginative on how you can use each strainer shape. SPACE SAVING - Our collapsible colander is less than 1.5 inch in height after being folded, which makes it convenient to place in any kitchen cabinet or drawer and that will greatly saves your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SHZmkQaYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NONATHEO","source_asin":"B09Z8MSZJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z8MSZJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z8MSZJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860506,"name":"VECELO Glider Upholstered Rocker Rocking Accent Chair Padded Seat with High Backrest Armchair, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":175.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pIrmBFFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From VECELO, A customer Orientated Enterprise> 99% positive feedback for customer service VECELO sofa chair set with footstool is backed up with 2 Year worry free and friendly customer service to ensure 100% satisfaction. For optimal use please check and tighten all the screws and bolts up every 6 months to ensure the stability. Item dimensions: chair: 31. 1 28. 3 39. 4inches, stool: 22. 44 16. 1 15Inwhat you get: 1 VECELO sofa chair, footstool, 1 pack of screws and bolts, installation manual, and friendly customer support. : We stand behind our products and provide 5 year worry-free quality assurance for VECELO product, email us at: support@vecelo if you need help. Good life starts from VECELO!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pIrmBFFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VECELO","source_asin":"B0C7H3TKDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7H3TKDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7H3TKDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860507,"name":"Camp Chef Camp Table with Legs 32\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u0vffRk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Camp Chef Camp Table is the perfect companion to any table top stove or dutch oven. The camp table will hold two 14 inch dutch ovens and provides extra preparation and serving space to keep your food up off the ground. Works great with the Mountain Series stoves from Camp Chef and is a great accessory piece to your free standing stove. Side shelves* (Model LS60P) can be added for even more space. Amazon.com The Camp Chef Camp Table offers plenty of room for outdoor chefs to organize their tools of the trade. Somehow, food just tastes better in the great outdoors. It's with this in mind that Camp Chef created a wide-ranging line of camping cookware designed to combine the versatility and cook quality of patio grilling with the portability of traditional camp stoves. The Camp Chef Large Dutch Oven Table lets you enjoy your camping culinary experience without the hassle of bending over to cook on the ground. With room for two 14-inch Dutch ovens on the 32-by-14-inch (W x D) cook surface, making it ideal for camping, tailgating, picnics, or grilling on the back patio. Its steel construction is safe for use with charcoal, while tubular steel legs provide a stable base of operations. The 28-pound table additionally boasts side and rear panels for protection from the wind. Optional side shelves (sold separately) can be added for additional prep space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u0vffRk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camp Chef","source_asin":"B000M9QJFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000M9QJFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000M9QJFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
