window.products.push({"id":860619,"name":"Velaychimney 33 Inches Electric Fireplace Insert, 750W/1500W Fireplace Heater with Adjustable Flame and Top Light Colors, Fire Crackling Sound, Remote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dJsjSq8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Dimensions & Attractive Design] Overall size: 33\"L X 8.8\"D X 24.7\"H, insert size: 29.6\"L X 7.7\"D X 23.6\"H. The fireplace has novel design with double glass doors, moveable mesh screen and black sturdy metal, meanwhile retains the traditional look with two-sided interior brick wall and faux log. Perfect for TV stands, bookshelf, fireplace wall, sideboards ect. [Warm Heater & Sleep Mode] Electric fireplace provides three adjustable heater modes (750W/100W/Off) according to warm and energy saving needs. The front heater blower spreads heat for a room up to 400 sq. ft. The recessed fireplace with sleep mode can turn off all light with heater working for better relaxing. [Leaping Flames & Crackling Sound] Flicker fuel bed and dancing flames bring a real fuel burning experience, optional 3 volume of crackling sound makes the real log burning effect adding sense of reality. Adjustable 3 flame and top light colors (yellow, blue, yellow-blue mixed) creates different ambiance, just used as a decoration without heat for all seasons. [2 Controls & Timer] Easily operate all functions at will by remote and panel control. Embedded 0-9h timing device will shutdown the fireplace heater when reach the setted time, get rid of the worries about safety and waste. Low noise with convenient operation offers a comfortable environment for resting. [Installation and Safety] This electric fireplace can be recessed into wall with provided instruction. It has overheating protection will turn off automatically when heater reach an unsafe temperature. Note: pls plug the power cord into a 110-120V outlet. We have 1 year warranty and 24h customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dJsjSq8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Velaychimney","source_asin":"B0BPJ1F44N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPJ1F44N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPJ1F44N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
