window.products.push({"id":860656,"name":"Espresso Tamper 51mm - Coffee Tamper 51mm -Espresso Press Tamper- Espresso Hand Tamper with Stainless Steel Base and Chacate Preto Wood Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Js21ZjXgL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","description":"☕51mm Size - The espresso tamper is designed to work with the tapered Breville portafilter baskets, including the Barista Express, Pro, Touch, Bambino Plus, Infuser, and Duo-Temp Pro. ☕High Quality Stainless Steel - Rest assured that you are getting your money's worth here. We use the highest quality, food-safe 100% stainless steel for our espresso tampers' base with no coating. Corrosion-resistant and rustproof. The wooden handle is made of premium Chacate Preto wood rather than cheap plastic. ☕THE KEY TO THE PERFECT ESPRESSO DRINK - For perfectionists who demand the best possible tasting espresso shot. The espresso tamper ensures you get a 100% PERFECT TAMP EVERY TIME. When fully compressed, the coffee grounds in the portafilter are compacted with consistent pressure every time. ☕PROVIDES CONSISTENT TAMPING PRESSURE EVERY TIME - Step up to by far the highest quality espresso tampers available anywhere at this price point. You will never need to repurchase another tamper and will save time, money, and frustration. ☕Pro Tips - Ensure your portafilter basket is fully dosed with coffee grinds to get the right amount of pressure from the espresso tamper for a tighter pack and richer flavor. For best results, groom the top of the basket with a finger or flat edge before leveling and tamping. If you're not satisfied with the products, we offer an unconditional money-payback guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Js21ZjXgL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KYONANO","source_asin":"B0C7Q4SZQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7Q4SZQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7Q4SZQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
