window.products.push({"id":860670,"name":"DEARCOOL Digital Commercial Price Scale, 88LB/40KG Electronic Price Computing Scale, Commercial Food Meat Fruit Weight Scale with LCD Display, Stainle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QvGeWUIZS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥦🥦Are you looking for a reliable Digital Price scale? Come and choose us! High-precision Using accurate and precise sensors for high-precision and reliable readings. Easy Reading in the Sun Green backlight and bold black font make it easier to clearly view the WEIGHT, UNIT PRICE and TOTAL PRICE. 3 Power Supply Modes ①Dry battery mode(3*D dry battery, not included). ②Built-in battery mode(Rechargeable). ③AC mode (Power cord included). Rocker ON/OFF switch On the bottom of the scale, 3 Positions adjustable: O→ON, Ⅰ→3*D dry battery, Ⅱ→Rechargeable battery or AC power. Stainless steel Platform Easy to clean, not easy to scratch, durable for a long time use. 2 adjustable feet Two of four feet are adjustable for keep balancing. Multiple Functions C(cancel), ADD(Accumulation operation), TARA, ZERO, STORE(unit prices storage), KG/LB Conversion, Backlight on/off. Power saving design Auto shut off function when no-use and backlight off mode for saving power. Safe Use Low battery indicator, AC power indicator, overload warning, and overvoltage warning ensure the service life of the scale and safety. 🥦🥦Know more about our Scale: Platform Size: 13” x 9.5” (L x W) Total Dimension: 13” x 13.5” x 4” (L x W x H) Product Weight: 7.9lbs Max weight: 88lb/40kg Min weight: 0.44lb/200g Division: 0.01lb/5g Built-in Rechargeable Battery: 4V 4AH/20HR Power: AC 110V Dry battery: 3*D dry battery (not included) 🥦Package Includes: 1 x Scale & 1 x Power Cord & 1 x User Manual 🥦Kindly Note: The scale does not work on ounces, it weights in KG (Kilogram) and LB (Pound).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QvGeWUIZS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEARCOOL","source_asin":"B092MJ2N8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MJ2N8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MJ2N8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
