window.products.push({"id":860744,"name":"Progressive International 8-Quart Spaghetti Steamer Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411Q1VQTTEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Progressive International's 8-quart spaghetti steamer 18/0 stainless steel. Set includes stockpot, an insert that doubles as a colander, a 2.5-inch removable steamer basket, a lid with adjustable vent holes, and comfort gripe handles. Amazon.com Made of 18/8 stainless steel, this set offers three cooking options in a single package. There's an 8-quart pot for simmering stocks and soups and cooking stews, an 8-quart colander that fits inside the pot for cooking and draining pasta, and a 2-1/2-inch-deep basket that also fits inside the pot for steaming vegetables and fish. A domed lid with an adjustable steam vent completes the set. The pot, lid, and a band around the top of the colander where it protrudes from the pot are all polished to a mirror finish, presenting a uniform exterior. Hollow handles on the pot and the colander stay cool on the stovetop. Both the colander and the steamer nest inside the pot for compact storage. The set is dishwasher-safe and carries a five-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411Q1VQTTEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B00005O0P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005O0P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005O0P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860745,"name":"Modern Concrete Tray - Minimalist Danish Designed, Providing a Unique Form to Showcase, Organize & Present - Hand-Poured in Denmark - Color White (15 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GfEpHjx9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Danish design company creating everyday decor products from the most natural form of concrete with the most advanced technologies. We have spent more than two years perfecting the technique to be able to produce our concrete product line in a unique form resulting in thin and smooth formations. Allowing for our designers to push the boundaries and fully express themselves. Equally important, we have been able to accomplish the above without the use of any additional chemicals such as epoxy and other additives commonly used in concrete products. Therefore keeping the products home-safe and odorless. Concrete is a growing contemporary trend that will give your space a modern upscale look with an urban sensibility.  Each piece is hand-poured individually and will have unique characteristics.  We make our products using 100% concrete and through the cutting-edge manufacturing process, we’ve been able to provide the highest quality and most durable concrete product in the market which is chemical and epoxy free.  All of our products are made with sustainability in mind and made with the purest materials that can re-integrate into the earth naturally.  Our products are hand-poured by artisans in Denmark and currently available in three beautiful contemporary honed concrete matte colors. Additionally, while concrete is considered to be food safe in this natural chemical free state, it hasn’t been tested for such and may absorb residues, coloring, and oils more frequently since it’s porous and the surface is unfinished. The Karin Collection designed by Noergaard Design in Denmark derives from the Nordic name meaning Clean + Tidy.   The Karin collection features modern functional trays and containers with rounded edges that offer a classic timeless design.  Use the tray and containers to organize items in your bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room or office.    CLEANING AND CARE: Spot clean with a damp cloth or equal part water and vinegar solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GfEpHjx9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIVIT","source_asin":"B07GTP2967","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GTP2967","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GTP2967","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
