window.products.push({"id":860882,"name":"VSUDO 17.7\" x 157.5\" No Glue Static Cling Privacy Window Film, Purple and Orange Circle Pattern Home Decor Window Tint Sticker (19.38 sq. ft)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619HEcooEZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. VSUDO decorative privacy window film can help us to make it happen. The window film can protect our privacy and keep home or office bright. Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use window films on window glass of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding door window, french window, cabinet panel. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Step: 1. Cut film to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle wet the glass with water, more water more better (JUST WATER, NOT USE GLASS CLEANER) 4. Peel off the back protective film (Sometime you will find it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides with adhesive tape then peel off) 5. Stick film on glass (Put the smooth side to window, don’t put the frosted side to the window) 6. Scrape a few more times with squeegee or abandoned credit cards to ensure the bubbles and water are completely removed 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 1 Roll Window Film: 17.7 by 157.5 inches (45 X 400CM), 19.38 sq. ft Tips: 1. This film is suitable for smooth, flat clean glass surface. Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other material. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before install. 4. Use a hair dryer to soften the film under cold weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619HEcooEZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B08LQQBJCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LQQBJCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LQQBJCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860883,"name":"Sleepme Dock Pro Sleep System – Industry Leading Cooling & Heating Mattress Topper, Automated Temperature Changes: 55-115°F, (Half King (80” L x 38” W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y2hxnh6KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WIDEST TEMPERATURE RANGE: Our water-based system is guaranteed to cool or warm your bed to your ideal sleep temperature (between 55-115°F) no matter your bedroom’s temperature or the heat load your body gives off. Industry-leading power The Dock Pro’s cutting edge technology allows it to rapidly cool or warm your bed. FITS ANY BED: Ultra-comfy mattress topper conforms to any size mattress from a queen to a cal king, even adjustable beds! Fits mattress heights between 8-18 inches. Full and half bed sizes available Half bed size (ME) is made for 1 sleeper. The full bed size (WE) is made for 2 sleepers with dual-zone temperature control so each sleeper can sleep at their ideal temperature. SCHEDULE AUTOMATED TEMPERATURE CHANGES: Flip your “sleep switch” with warmth to trigger sleep, then schedule cool comfort for deep sleep support all night long all through our mobile app. DISCREET IN SIZE: Easily place your control unit at the head or foot of the bed, on a nightstand or shelf. The unit’s sleek design easily fits under bed frames over 6.5 inches in height. EASY TO CLEAN AND MAINTAIN: Our mattress topper is 100% machine washable and dryable. SLEEPME SLEEP TRACKER COMPATIBLE: Pair the Dock Pro with our Sleep Tracker and you'll receive real-time, AI-driven adjustments to your bed temperature to improve the quality of your sleep. Eligible for health savings accounts (HSA) and flexible spending accounts (FSA) With a prescription from a medical professional or Letter of Medical Necessity (LOMN).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y2hxnh6KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepme","source_asin":"B0B3QHMTWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3QHMTWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3QHMTWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
