window.products.push({"id":860896,"name":"ManGotree Ultra-Thin Velvet Hangers 36 Pack, Non-Slip Felt Hangers with 360 Swivel Rose Gold Hook, Sturdy & Durable Clothes Hangers for Coats, Sweater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFM0WPnvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Velvet Hangers]: Made of high quality ABS plastic, the Velvet Hangers come with rose gold hooks on each hanger to brighten up your closet. The 360° rotatable rose gold hooks allow you to easily view, hang and access your clothes from multiple angles and directions. [Non-slip Design]: The velvet covering the surface of the adult hanger is soft to the touch and prevents clothes from wrinkling and slipping off. Notches at the ends of the shoulders make it easy to secure vests, shirts, skirts and any garment with straps or a wide neck. [Robust Space Saver]: The ultra-thin design maximizes storage space and helps add extra space to your closet to hang more clothes, making the most of your closet and room to keep it clutter-free. The sturdy and durable felt hangers are great for hanging any coats/sweaters/suits/jackets/pants you may have. [Dual Functions]: Hang your tops, pants or both on the velvet hangers with contoured shoulders that help keep your clothes in shape. Featuring contoured 17.3\" wide shoulders and a horizontal pants crossbar design, the possibilities for hanging and organization are endless. [ManGotree Notes]: Before use, blow with a hair dryer or over the water and then air dry, can effectively remove the surface floating hairs, due to the characteristics of flocking hangers, the new production of hangers and its packing bag will stick on a little floating hairs, is a normal phenomenon, not a quality problem, please rest assured that the purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFM0WPnvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ManGotree","source_asin":"B0BLTP6K1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLTP6K1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLTP6K1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
