window.products.push({"id":860986,"name":"Salamander Chameleon Sonoma 329 Twin-Width A/V Cabinet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2499.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iAB3cAHhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sonoma, a mission-influenced style, has doors that contrast vertical wooden strips with black, micro-perforated metal inserts. Its American Cherry tone and relaxed look work especially well in transitional rooms. From the Manufacturer Why You Need Salamander Chameleon Audio/Video Furniture Furniture designed for audio and video components is important because it incorporates features that improve the performance of your home theater system. Traditional furniture manufacturers do not take into consideration important aspects such as Ventilation, infrared passthrough for remote controls, and removable rear panels for component access, wire management and media storage. The Chameleon series by Salamander Designs is a modern storage system for todays home theater. Its innovative and award-winning design provides unparalleled flexibility with the design of tailored furniture systems. A full line of refined elements and accessories allows owners to fine-tune individual systems to keep pace with their growing requirements. A delicate balance of high-quality materials gives Chameleon distinct form and function. Extruded aluminum posts provide the aesthetic and functional backbone, and the oversized hardwood shelves enhance its bold and beautiful appeal. An elegantly simple design is advanced by thoughtful details, such as optional flat-panel TV mounts, choice between caster wheels and designer cabinet feet, and easily-removable rear panels. Inside Salamander's Chameleon Series Salamander Design's newly released Chameleon series will change your view of entertainment furniture. The Sonoma, one of the four available Chameleon designs, is influenced by the popular Arts and Crafts Mission style. A compelling appearance meets strong support for TVs and other entertainment platforms. Sonoma has doors that contrast vertical wooden strips with black, micro-perforated metal inserts. Its American Cherry tone and relaxed look work especially well in transitional rooms such as family rooms, recreational rooms and enclosed patio rooms--anywhere you want to entertain in style and comfort. Sonoma's Quality Features This A/V cabinet comes with twin- and triple-rack options with two or three cabinet doors depending on the model number (see below for various model numbers and sizes). All of the Chameleon series A/V cabinets are 21.25 inches deep and are between 44 and 65 inches long that allow you to fit them into any room in your home. It has two interior height-adjustable shelves within all of the different sizes of the Salamander Design's Chameleon series to fit your entertainment needs - from DVD players to stereo systems to gaming consoles.  It has a rock-solid framework and a gorgeous, clean look. The 'smart' and rigid aluminum frame comfortably supports the all solid wood doors that close and open with soft-close dampeners. Cooling air flow is never a problem with ventilation louvers built right into cabinet bottoms and 'pinch-out' easily removable rear panels allow for easy access for rearranging A/V hardware and wires whenever the need arises. Salamander Design's Chameleon Series Contains a 'Smart' Aluminum Skeleton Salamander Design's Chameleon series has a 'smart' aluminum skeleton. This rock-solid framework securely holds an array of high performance accessories while hiding them from view. The Chameleon series is rich with structural features that benefit from this hidden framework. From the ability to switch between different styles of footing - wheels or feet in wood or metal to add accessories like an IR repeater or cooling kit directly to the A/V cabinet frame without loss of structural integrity while holding all of your entertainment hardware. Optional Accessories Make Chameleon Adapt to Your Living Space Wide Variety of Sizes to Fit Any Space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iAB3cAHhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Salamander Designs","source_asin":"B00I3AQJ1I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3AQJ1I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3AQJ1I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":860987,"name":"Lenphsco Toilet Bowl Brush and Holder Set 2 Pack, Silicone Bristles Bathroom Cleaning Bowl Brush, 304 Stainless Steel Handle, Floor Standing & Wall Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBks1K-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Innovative Toilet Brush】Looking for a toilet brush that's durable, hygienic, and won't tip over easily? Look no further than our innovative toilet brush, featuring a durable silicone brush head and a heavy 304 stainless steel base and handle. 【Premium Silicone Material Bristles】Our toilet brush's silicone bristles are tough on dirt and grime but gentle on your toilet bowl, ensuring a thorough clean without scratching or damaging the surface.The flexible silicone bristles are able to reach all the nooks and crannies of your toilet bowl, ensuring a thorough clean every time. 【Stainless Steel Material】The 304 stainless steel base and handle provide exceptional durability and stability. 304 stainless steel is a strong and durable material that can withstand heavy use and regular cleaning,it won't rust or tarnish over time. This means that our toilet brush will last longer than brushes made from other materials, providing you with a cost-effective and long-lasting cleaning solution. 【Stable Holder】The weight of the stainless steel holder helps to keep the toilet brush upright and stable, reducing the risk of tipping over and preventing the brush from coming into contact with the floor or other surfaces. This promotes a more hygienic bathroom environment.So why settle for a flimsy or unattractive holder when you can enjoy the benefits of our high-quality design? 【Two Placement Methods Optional】This versatile holder can be placed firmly on the bathroom floor without the worry of tipping over, thanks to its sturdy and stable design. Alternatively, you can easily hang it on the wall without the need for drilling holes, keeping your bathroom tidy and clutter-free. With its dual placement options, you can choose the perfect location for your toilet brush holder and enjoy a clean and organized bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBks1K-6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenphsco","source_asin":"B0BC7Y4RWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-860987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC7Y4RWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC7Y4RWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
